---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Our Care | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Our care</div><h1>Care that fits a student's real life.</h1><p class="lead">Most college health services are built for a sore throat. Students with ongoing health needs deserve more than that.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="grid">
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg><h3>Chronic condition care</h3><p>Ongoing management for conditions such as asthma, diabetes, ADHD, allergies, migraines and digestive conditions. [CONFIRM SCOPE]</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-moon"/></svg><h3>Mental wellbeing</h3><p>Anxiety, low mood and stress are common at college. We notice early and help, or connect you to the right specialist.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg><h3>Same-day sick visits</h3><p>Illness, injury, refills. Seen quickly, by a doctor who knows them.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-leaf"/></svg><h3>Whole-person wellness</h3><p>Sleep, nutrition, movement and habits that make a hard semester easier.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-compass"/></svg><h3>Care coordination</h3><p>Specialists, labs, prescriptions, and a bridge to the doctor back home.</p></div>
<div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><h3>Direct line</h3><p>Message us when something feels off. [RESPONSE TIME]</p></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">A semester with us</div><h2>We show up at the hard parts.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num">Fall</div><p>Move-in check-in, health plan, refills sorted before classes get busy.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">Midterms</div><p>A check-in on sleep, stress, and how they're really doing.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">Finals</div><p>Extra support when the pressure peaks.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">Breaks</div><p>A handoff plan for home, and travel health questions answered.</p></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
